+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause-Patent
+ *
+ * K60 (Redmi K60 / mondrian / SM8475) AW882xx smart-PA driver.
+ *
+ * EXPERIMENTAL: this file is compiled from source and syntax-checked only.
+ * It has NOT been run on hardware and it is NOT a complete vendor driver:
+ * the AW882xx register map, chip-ID values, protection policy and power
+ * sequencing are not available in this workspace. Every such item is marked
+ * TODO/AW882XX_TODO below and must not be treated as a measured value.
+ *
+ * Board facts (all from the K60 live FDT; see
+ * /mnt/e/k60-work/scratch/audio-work/EVIDENCE.md):
+ *   - Bus: /soc/i2c@880000 (QUPV3_2 SE15), GPIO56=SCL / GPIO57=SDA,
+ *     function qup15, 2 mA pull-up (live-fdt.dts:13301-13316, 3562-3594)
+ *   - TOP: I2C 0x34, reset GPIO1, IRQ GPIO88 (flags 0x2008), spksw GPIO52,
+ *     sound-channel 0 (live-fdt.dts:13318-13329)
+ *   - BOT: I2C 0x35, reset GPIO3, IRQ GPIO63 (flags 0x2008),
+ *     sound-channel 1 (live-fdt.dts:13331-13341)
+ *   - No vdd/vbat supply property exists on either node
+ *     (live-fdt.dts:13318-13341). Do not write guessed PMIC votes.
+ *
+ * Eight-step pipeline status (E:/k60-work/docs/PORTING-PIPELINE.md):
+ *   (1) same-hardware: Pong/Sheng smart-PA frameworks only; AW882xx has no
+ *       local implementation (REUSE.md section 4.4)
+ *   (2) official docs: AW882xx datasheet/vendor driver NOT available
+ *   (3) reverse + device data: FDT line facts above; no AW882xx register dump
+ *   (4) wide validation: only one independent hardware source (K60 FDT)
+ *   (5) plan: see PLAN.md P2B
+ *   (6) deep dive: see REPORT.md sections
+ *   (7) verification: compile-only here; register values are TODO/推断
+ *   (8) on-device: not attempted
+ */
+
